# Thu muc chi chua anh san pham do nguoi dung tai len. Chan truy cap moi loai file script o day
# lam LOP PHONG THU THU HAI: duong tai len hien da ep duoi file theo MIME that do may chu tu doc
# (product_image_upload.php), ten file cung do he thong sinh ngau nhien - nhung neu ve sau co ai
# noi long cho do thi lop nay van con chan.
# Chi dung <FilesMatch> vi day la dang da biet chac chay duoc tren may chu nay (giong .htaccess
# goc); cac chi thi Options/AddType co the bi cam o cap thu muc va gay loi 500 cho ca thu muc anh.
<FilesMatch "\.(php|php[0-9]|phtml|phar|pl|py|cgi|sh)$">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>
